  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> can be written as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence, solutions in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> are<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Sum of the elements is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
